{"id":"u-4e1e0241-4b6f-4a0f-ac3b-6f0c62b2a7a6","src":"community","title":"5/3/1: Performance & Hypertrophy","author":"Bryce  T.","url":"https://www.boostcamp.app/users/JN9UXI-531-power-and-hypertrophy-1","desc":"A powerbuilding program built around 5/3/1 strength progression, with targeted hypertrophy and athletic performance work. The program combines heavy compound lifts with bodybuilding accessories, explosive jumps, sprinting, and conditioning to build strength and muscle while developing speed, power, and overall physical performance.\n\nTM = Training max 85-90% of current max should be used for this program.\n\nAfter completing the cycle add 5 lbs. to bench press/overhead press TM and 10 lbs. to squat and deadlift TM then restart the program. \n\nThe Week 4 deload is optional; if you are feeling strong and fully recovered, skip it and keep pushing. Only deload when your body tells you it is necessary, though it is recommended to take a structured deload after completing three full program cycles (every 9 weeks), making Week 10 your official recovery week.","level":["Intermediate"],"goals":["Muscle","Strength","Athletics"],"equipment":["Full Gym"],"minutes":70,"joins":2,"rate":0,"rateCount":0,"updated":"2026-10-01T02:52:44.118Z","variations":[{"name":"default","days":["Day 1","Day 2","Day 3","Day 4","Day 5","Day 6"],"weeks":[[{"ex":[{"n":"Bench Press (Barbell)","sets":[{"r":5,"pct":65},{"r":5,"pct":75},{"r":5,"pct":85}]},{"n":"Incline Bench Press (Barbell)","sets":[{"lo":6,"hi":10,"x":4}]},{"n":"Dip (Weighted)","sets":[{"lo":6,"hi":8,"x":3}]},{"n":"Tricep Pushdown (Cable)","sets":[{"lo":8,"hi":15,"x":3}]},{"n":"Skull Crusher (EZ Bar)","sets":[{"lo":8,"hi":15,"x":3}]}]},{"ex":[{"n":"Squat (Barbell)","sets":[{"r":5,"pct":65},{"r":5,"pct":75},{"r":5,"pct":85}]},{"n":"Leg Press (45 Degrees)","sets":[{"lo":8,"hi":12,"x":3}]},{"n":"Leg Extension","sets":[{"lo":10,"hi":15,"x":3}]},{"n":"Leg Curl","sets":[{"lo":8,"hi":15,"x":3}]},{"n":"Decline Sit Up (Weighted)","sets"